      "title": "📖 RENDER VARIATIONS STUDIO v3 — read me",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "🏛️ ONE INPUT, FOUR HIGH-END VARIATIONS\n\nDrop a basic render or screenshot in the INPUT IMAGE node. Each branch's\n(AV) Matrix node has 10 dropdowns — pick combinations to get 4 distinct\nvariations in parallel. The architecture stays preserved.\n\n🎛️ THE 10 CATEGORIES (in (AV) Matrix nodes)\n\n  preservation   — anchors geometry (most important)\n  camera         — composition / viewpoint\n  lighting       — time of day\n  atmosphere     — weather / haze\n  style          — photographic equipment + aesthetic\n  materials      — palette (includes firm signature)\n  people         — figures with ethnicity options\n  scale_life     — activity level\n  cars           — hero vehicles\n  surroundings   — context (preserve_input is the safe default)\n\nPick (none) on any axis you don't want active.\n\n✏️ Edit ComfyUI/user/archviz_presets.json to add or modify presets.\nRestart ComfyUI for new preset names; existing text edits apply on next run."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
